1. Engagement — the requirement itself answers the surface question. Read without consulting the prerequisites, the requirement fixes all of:
   (a) the verb form: one verb in the verb position, with the handles as that verb's arguments;
   (b) the handle as the only key that addresses a draft, with no node id, edit or workspace standing in its place;
   (c) one open draft per handle as the call's subject;
   (d) refusal of the whole call, with nothing discarded, when any handle names no open record;
   (e) that the call writes no node and no change.
   Fail on any item the requirement leaves unanswered or answers only by inference from a prerequisite — name the item.
2. Licence against the discard surface (kxyznwxu). No element of the requirement contradicts the surface commitment: one verb in the verb position with everything after it that verb's arguments; a call naming one or more handles and nothing else; each handle picking out one record and therefore one draft; the handle as the only key, with the target node, the edit and the workspace references rather than keys, so a node id picks out no record; only an open record as a subject, with a landed record and a handle the directory does not name both refused; one answer per invocation, so a handle naming no open record refuses the call whole with nothing discarded; the argument surface answered before the store is reached, a handle being well formed whatever it names; drift not being a refusal; and the call writing no node and no change and being none of the three operations. Fail on any contradicting element — name it.
3. Licence against the landed end (slwvtspu). No element contradicts: the discard ends an open draft without landing it; only an open draft is a subject; the call creates no node and no change, opens no bracket, writes no marker, and gives undo and redo no unit. Fail on any contradicting element — name it.
4. Licence against the store (twpvqstu). No element contradicts: a handle names exactly one document and therefore exactly one record; a handle the directory does not name is a record that is not there; a landed record is retained at its handle and is never the one removed; a discarded record's absence is not a third state. Fail on any contradicting element — name it.
5. No added rule; out-of-scope matters left alone. The requirement invents no rule its prerequisites do not state and decides nothing the surface leaves elsewhere. It does not decide the store's removal; the draft's workspace and directory mechanics; drift handling beyond the subject question; the change-side act; the removal guard; the handle's form or minting; whether a well-formed call needs a repository root; or the success output, the refusal's wording, stream and exit status, and the help text. Relying on any of these is not deciding it; deciding any of them fails — name the item.
